# category|driver keys
# Drivers' categories (2026-10-14 user, WS232 p004: "プラットフォームによって
# 選べるドライバが変わらない実装にしてください。Platformドライバだけ変えます。
# また、PiのドライバはPlatformにまとめていいです。"): every category but
# Platform lists the same bus drivers (config/drivers/{isa,pci,usb}.drivers)
# on every CPU.  Platform lists the drivers of config/drivers/architecture/
# that name the chosen platform, the always-built ones too, in that file's
# order: a driver of a board is in Platform alone, and only on its board.
# Each bus driver is in one category here; an architecture driver is in none.
Disk|CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_NVME CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_AHCI CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_STORAGE
Input|CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_HID CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_LPSS_I2C
GPU|CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_VENUS CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_I915 CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_NVRTX
Audio|CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_HDA
Ethernet|CONFIG_DRIVER_NE2000 CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_CDC_NCM CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_CDC_ECM
WiFi|CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_INTEL_AX211 CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_RTL8822BU
Bluetooth|CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_BT
USB|CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_UHCI CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_EHCI CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_XHCI CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_HUB CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_CCID
Platform|
